# Scenario "party" (PAL, milestone 8, playable game with replayed inputs): the whole birthday party (stage 14) of a new
# game, from the title screen to the first change of stage. It replays play/GGTP01/first-task.scn (frames up to 11900)
# then gives the rose to Jenny (the task Telly gives next), the candles, the end-of-party text on a black screen,
# and the script's warp to stage 5 (the Chibi-House, first night): ends on Telly's first line there.
# Inputs written by hand from screenshots of native runs (cycle clock, RTC 800000000), no game data here.
# Route from the vase (directions are relative to the camera, which turns as Chibi-Robo walks): stick up-left behind
# the cake, then left twice to reach the table edge on Mrs. Sanderson's side, then up along the edge until the
# "!" icon shows next to Jenny. B puts the Chibi-Copter away (copter equipped, A at the "!" did nothing in our runs),
# then A every 54 frames: talk, the give prompt, item menu (the rose is selected), every dialogue box.
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario, see play/README.md); run it with tools/run.py --scenario <this file>.
# Recorded on GGTP01; the US version of the same route is play/GGTE01/party.scn.
